This one means something special. 🏉
Saturday marks the inaugural Peter Gray Memorial Cup — our 1st XV take on Old Leamingtonians in honour of a man who gave everything to this club as a player, supporter, and president. A name close to many hearts, and a occasion worth celebrating together.
The Lions and Colts are also in action at Moorefields from 2pm — it’s a huge home Saturday and we want to see the place packed out. Come down, get behind the lads, and help us make Peter’s first cup a day to remember. 💙💛❤️

Our Women’s side are also in action this weekend, travelling to Oadby Wyggestonians on Sunday to take on Northampton Casuals in the Inner Warrior Series. 

